1
00:00:00,778 --> 00:00:02,923
Every organization runs on data.

2
00:00:02,973 --> 00:00:07,312
But the answers people need are
locked inside different systems,

3
00:00:07,362 --> 00:00:11,222
and getting them usually means
waiting days for a report.

4
00:00:11,872 --> 00:00:15,069
Meet Wabi Insight, by WabiTex Solutions.

5
00:00:15,119 --> 00:00:18,478
Ask a question in plain English or Arabic,

6
00:00:18,528 --> 00:00:23,429
and get a verified answer from
your own databases in seconds.

7
00:00:23,479 --> 00:00:24,160
Securely.

8
00:00:25,389 --> 00:00:30,092
Wabi Insight is built for any
organization: banks and insurers,

9
00:00:30,142 --> 00:00:36,428
airlines and airports, hospitals, government
entities, retailers, telecom operators,

10
00:00:36,478 --> 00:00:41,558
universities, logistics companies,
hotels, energy and manufacturing.

11
00:00:42,975 --> 00:00:48,370
If your data lives in SQL Server or
Oracle, Wabi Insight can work with it.

12
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:52,344
Contact WabiTex Solutions
for a demo on your own data,

13
00:00:52,394 --> 00:00:56,391
and we will organize the
setup together with your team.

14
00:00:57,618 --> 00:00:59,134
Here is how it works.

15
00:00:59,184 --> 00:01:04,129
Your administrators connect your
databases with read-only accounts,

16
00:01:04,179 --> 00:01:09,199
and decide exactly which tables,
columns and rows each role may see.

17
00:01:09,849 --> 00:01:15,090
When someone asks a question, the AI
writes a structured plan, never SQL.

18
00:01:15,140 --> 00:01:20,743
Wabi Insight checks that plan against
the person's permissions, builds a safe,

19
00:01:20,793 --> 00:01:24,077
read-only query, and runs it on your database.

20
00:01:24,727 --> 00:01:28,938
So every number on the screen
comes from a verified query.

21
00:01:30,163 --> 00:01:35,540
Let's see it working on Wabi Bank, a
fictional bank with five systems: personnel,

22
00:01:35,590 --> 00:01:39,561
core banking, finance, digital
banking and the IT help desk,

23
00:01:39,611 --> 00:01:41,839
and staff in many different roles.

24
00:01:42,716 --> 00:01:46,263
Clara is the bank's
organization administrator.

25
00:01:46,313 --> 00:01:52,080
Her dashboard shows users, sign-ins and
activity, for her organization only.

26
00:01:52,730 --> 00:01:55,936
Under Applications, she connects each system.

27
00:01:55,986 --> 00:02:02,013
Every connection is encrypted on the server,
and tested to confirm it can only read.

28
00:02:03,105 --> 00:02:08,409
The catalogue lists each table and
column, with English and Arabic names,

29
00:02:08,459 --> 00:02:11,270
descriptions and a data classification.

30
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:14,350
Only approved objects can ever be queried.

31
00:02:15,359 --> 00:02:19,681
Roles describe what people do,
and permissions are set per role.

32
00:02:19,731 --> 00:02:24,873
A branch manager, for example, reads
core banking only for their own branch,

33
00:02:24,923 --> 00:02:27,196
and never sees restricted columns.

34
00:02:28,270 --> 00:02:31,934
Users are added with their
department, section and roles,

35
00:02:31,984 --> 00:02:34,931
and receive their temporary password by email.

36
00:02:36,391 --> 00:02:41,365
Now Victor, the chief executive. On
the Ask page he chooses a system,

37
00:02:41,415 --> 00:02:45,662
and types his question, or
picks one of the suggested ones.

38
00:02:46,848 --> 00:02:49,679
In seconds: a chart, the verified figures,

39
00:02:49,729 --> 00:02:52,696
and a written explanation of what they mean.

40
00:02:53,346 --> 00:02:56,710
How this was computed
explains, in plain words,

41
00:02:56,760 --> 00:03:00,777
which data was used and how
it was grouped and filtered.

42
00:03:00,827 --> 00:03:05,206
And every query is logged on
the server for accuracy reviews.

43
00:03:06,029 --> 00:03:10,634
Ask for a dashboard, and Wabi
Insight builds one: headline numbers,

44
00:03:10,684 --> 00:03:14,524
trends and breakdowns, each
from its own verified query.

45
00:03:17,682 --> 00:03:21,494
Here are all the IT incidents
of the year, by priority,

46
00:03:21,544 --> 00:03:23,600
by month and by support group.

47
00:03:25,092 --> 00:03:28,163
For deeper questions, ask for a study.

48
00:03:28,213 --> 00:03:33,254
Wabi Insight runs up to ten
queries, explains what stands out,

49
00:03:33,304 --> 00:03:35,965
and writes a complete PDF report.

50
00:03:36,832 --> 00:03:41,894
The report has a cover, contents,
charts, findings and recommendations,

51
00:03:41,944 --> 00:03:43,911
ready to download and share.

52
00:03:45,050 --> 00:03:49,307
Every figure in it is the same
verified data you saw on screen.

53
00:03:50,725 --> 00:03:54,169
It also writes your emails. Ask for an email,

54
00:03:54,219 --> 00:03:59,137
and you get a ready-to-send draft
built on the verified figures.

55
00:04:01,048 --> 00:04:07,063
Ask for a report and an email together, and
the PDF report is attached to the draft.

56
00:04:07,113 --> 00:04:12,261
Here, Victor asks for third-quarter
expenses against the revised budget,

57
00:04:12,311 --> 00:04:14,139
for the finance committee.

58
00:04:16,263 --> 00:04:21,321
The report is attached, the email
is written, and one click copies it.

59
00:04:23,574 --> 00:04:29,422
And everything works in Arabic too: right
to left, with Arabic numbers and dates.

60
00:04:34,740 --> 00:04:40,077
Every answer is saved in My History,
with its question, its type and its cost.

61
00:04:40,966 --> 00:04:44,636
Open one to see its
versions. Run it again later,

62
00:04:44,686 --> 00:04:48,658
and you get a new version
without losing the old one.

63
00:04:50,876 --> 00:04:57,827
Mark favorites, group analyses into
collections, and export to PDF, Word or Excel.

64
00:05:07,846 --> 00:05:12,535
These are real files created
by Wabi Insight: a PDF study,

65
00:05:12,585 --> 00:05:15,639
a Word document and an Excel workbook.

66
00:05:15,689 --> 00:05:18,499
My Reports keeps every one of them.

67
00:05:19,853 --> 00:05:24,864
Share an analysis with a colleague,
with a message and an expiry date.

68
00:05:24,914 --> 00:05:28,913
They see exactly what you
saw. Nothing is queried again.

69
00:05:35,027 --> 00:05:40,225
Or send it by email. Wabi Insight
checks the data's classification first:

70
00:05:40,275 --> 00:05:43,533
restricted data never leaves the organization,

71
00:05:43,583 --> 00:05:47,200
and confidential data needs
your explicit approval.

72
00:05:48,022 --> 00:05:50,886
Permissions apply to every single question.

73
00:05:50,936 --> 00:05:55,225
When the Deira branch manager
asks for cash deposits per teller,

74
00:05:55,275 --> 00:05:58,953
only Deira's tellers come
back, and the answer says so.

75
00:05:59,603 --> 00:06:03,628
A teller asking about cash
sees only her own postings.

76
00:06:07,782 --> 00:06:11,853
And when the HR officer asks
for Emirates ID numbers,

77
00:06:11,903 --> 00:06:17,217
that column is restricted for her
role, so the AI never even sees it.

78
00:06:20,215 --> 00:06:24,960
Each organization's data is fully
separated, every action is audited,

79
00:06:25,010 --> 00:06:29,267
and even platform support can
only come in with your approval.

80
00:06:30,088 --> 00:06:34,147
Wabi Insight also works for
you when nobody is asking.

81
00:06:34,197 --> 00:06:37,722
Monitoring Rules watch
your data on a schedule.

82
00:06:38,372 --> 00:06:42,681
Describe a rule in plain
words. Wabi Insight drafts it,

83
00:06:42,731 --> 00:06:45,216
and you review it before saving.

84
00:06:51,878 --> 00:06:55,717
Each rule runs under its
owner's permissions, never more.

85
00:06:59,489 --> 00:07:04,048
When a rule fires, an alert appears,
and the right people are notified.

86
00:07:05,074 --> 00:07:10,702
Here, an individual customer deposited just
under fifty thousand dirhams in cash on

87
00:07:10,752 --> 00:07:14,533
several days, then fifty-eight
thousand in a single day.

88
00:07:15,183 --> 00:07:17,635
Laura acknowledges it with a note.

89
00:07:17,685 --> 00:07:22,051
Alerts inform people; they never
block anyone automatically.

90
00:07:23,384 --> 00:07:26,792
Access rules watch how data is used, too.

91
00:07:26,842 --> 00:07:33,372
When someone outside compliance looks
up KYC documents, compliance is alerted.

92
00:07:33,422 --> 00:07:36,577
And everyone can get one daily digest.

93
00:07:37,399 --> 00:07:40,137
Need the same report every week?

94
00:07:40,187 --> 00:07:46,322
Periodic Reports email a saved analysis
on a schedule, as PDF or Excel.

95
00:07:51,561 --> 00:07:56,097
Each recipient receives figures
computed under their own permissions.

96
00:07:57,853 --> 00:08:03,709
Administrators also see how Wabi Insight
is used in their organization: users,

97
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:06,661
sign-ins and activity, over any period.

98
00:08:07,517 --> 00:08:11,994
And the Support Desk tracks every
request with the WabiTex team,

99
00:08:12,044 --> 00:08:14,328
from first message to resolution.

100
00:08:17,488 --> 00:08:24,008
Wabi Insight: verified answers, dashboards,
reports and alerts from your own data.

101
00:08:24,058 --> 00:08:28,013
Secure, bilingual, and
ready for any organization.

102
00:08:28,883 --> 00:08:33,675
Contact WabiTex Solutions
today for a demo on your data.

103
